
### 1. Add multiple shopping items
POST http://localhost:3000/items
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "name": "Banana",
    "quantity": 5,
    "purchased": false
  },
  {
    "name": "Apple",
    "quantity": 10,
    "purchased": false
  },
  {
    "name": "Orange",
    "quantity": 8,
    "purchased": false
  }
]

###

### 2. Get all shopping items
GET http://localhost:3000/items

###

### 3. Get one item by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/items/2

###

### 4. Update an item
PUT http://localhost:3000/items/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 3,
  "purchased": true
}

###

### 5. Delete an item
DELETE http://localhost:3000/items/3
